msgstr "测试通信故障：set heartbeat 0"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:304
#: 3cad4bde87344956bc1630827280c737
msgid "Test fence failure: switch to CRUISE mode and fly across boundary"
msgstr "测试围栏故障：切换至 CRUISE 模式并飞越边界"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:305
#: e9a75026204d42f3a0ecd68303ed1590
msgid "Test QNH failure: param set :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` = 100"
msgstr "测试 QNH 故障：param set :ref:`AFS_AMSL_LIMIT<AFS_AMSL_LIMIT>` = 100"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:308
#: b856b79f5b044dbdbccdf9663dba2263
msgid "Additional tips for AFS failsafe users"
msgstr "AFS 失控保护用户的额外建议"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:310
#: 3e159531515243ec928ba9d5c54aa751
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You need to ensure that your geofence is enabled before takeoff. This can"
" either be done as part of your preflight checklist, or you could set the"
" fence enable RC switch auxiliary function (RCx_OPTION = 11) and enable "
"it from within your transmitter.  This ensures that if your transmitter "
"is out of range that the fence remains enabled."
msgstr ""
"您需要确保在起飞前已启用电子围栏。可以将其纳入起飞前检查清单，或设置 `FENCE_CHANNEL`` "
"并通过遥控器启用，以确保遥控器超出范围时围栏仍保持启用状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:316
#: fa32acfaaaf848c1b4b9dc84bf6b7904
msgid "Settings for Outback Challenge 2014"
msgstr "Outback Challenge 2014 的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:318
#: f44bf6e6c0d740d3ae618f5ac6e2a414
msgid ""
"To be compliant with the OBC 2014 rules you should have the following "
"settings:"
msgstr "要符合 OBC 2014 规则，应进行以下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/advanced-failsafe-configuration.rst:321
#: 57224cc8fdac488aa2c00e6a1141793b
